# Super App API — try the endpoints from Visual Studio or VS Code (REST Client).
# Run the API first (https profile). Requests are sent in order with the same cookies.
#
# How changes work: every POST / PUT / PATCH needs the anti-forgery token from GET /auth/csrf in the
# X-CSRF-TOKEN header. Run "csrf" first, copy data.token into @csrf below, and run it again after a sign-in.
# Fake values only — never put real passwords in this file.

@host = https://localhost:7254
@api = {{host}}/api/v1
@csrf = paste-the-token-here

### Health (no sign-in)
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### csrf — copy data.token into @csrf
GET {{api}}/auth/csrf
Accept: application/json

### Public lookups
GET {{api}}/lookups/governorates
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{api}}/lookups/settings/public
Accept: application/json

### Sign up (a test customer)
POST {{api}}/auth/sign-up
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{
  "fullName": "Test Player",
  "email": "test.player@example.test",
  "phone": "01012345678",
  "password": "TestOnly2026",
  "acceptTerms": true,
  "language": "ar"
}

### Sign in (email or mobile) — then run csrf again
POST {{api}}/auth/sign-in
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{ "login": "test.player@example.test", "password": "TestOnly2026" }

### My account
GET {{api}}/me
Accept: application/json

### Change my name and language
PATCH {{api}}/me
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{ "fullName": "Test Player Two", "language": "en" }

### My applications
GET {{api}}/applications/mine
Accept: application/json

### Forgot password (always 202; the email is saved in src/SuperApp.Api/emails)
POST {{api}}/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{ "email": "test.player@example.test" }

### Second step of sign-in for team accounts (code from the authenticator app)
POST {{api}}/auth/2fa/verify
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{ "code": "123456" }

### CEO: the team (needs the CEO signed in with the authenticator code)
GET {{api}}/ceo/admins
Accept: application/json

### CEO: roles and their permissions
GET {{api}}/ceo/roles
Accept: application/json

### Admin: applications waiting (needs an approvals permission + authenticator code)
GET {{api}}/admin/approvals?status=Pending
Accept: application/json

### Partner: my venues and pitches (signed in as a pitch partner or their staff)
GET {{api}}/partner/venues
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{api}}/partner/pitches
Accept: application/json

### Partner: add a pitch (waits for the admin's review). openingHours: 7 rows, closeHour up to 30 (26 = 2 AM)
POST {{api}}/partner/pitches
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{ "venueId": 1, "name": "Arena Five", "format": 5, "surface": "ArtificialTurf", "isIndoor": false, "pricePerHour": 600, "peakPricePerHour": 750, "peakFromHour": 18,
  "policyKey": "standard", "allowCash": true, "facilities": ["lights", "parking"],
  "openingHours": [ { "dayOfWeek": 0, "openHour": 9, "closeHour": 26, "isClosed": false }, { "dayOfWeek": 1, "openHour": 9, "closeHour": 26, "isClosed": false },
    { "dayOfWeek": 2, "openHour": 9, "closeHour": 26, "isClosed": false }, { "dayOfWeek": 3, "openHour": 9, "closeHour": 26, "isClosed": false },
    { "dayOfWeek": 4, "openHour": 9, "closeHour": 26, "isClosed": false }, { "dayOfWeek": 5, "openHour": 9, "closeHour": 26, "isClosed": false },
    { "dayOfWeek": 6, "openHour": 9, "closeHour": 26, "isClosed": false } ] }

### Partner: block hours (409 bookings_in_range when booked hours fall inside)
POST {{api}}/partner/pitches/1/closures
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{ "fromDate": "2026-11-01", "toDate": "2026-11-01", "fromHour": 9, "toHour": 12, "reason": "Maintenance" }

### Partner: bookings (status=upcoming|past|cancelled|noshow|all, q = code / name / phone)
GET {{api}}/partner/bookings?status=upcoming
Accept: application/json

### Partner: bookings as Excel (dashboard sheet first)
GET {{api}}/partner/bookings/export.xlsx?status=all

### Partner: walk-in (no fee, no commission)
POST {{api}}/partner/bookings/walk-in
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{ "pitchId": 1, "date": "2026-11-01", "hour": 20, "duration": 1, "name": "Captain Karim", "phone": "01012345678" }

### Partner: cancel a booking (the player gets a full refund)
POST {{api}}/partner/bookings/SA-XXXXXXXX/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{ "reason": "Floodlights repair" }

### Check-in: scan a QR token or a typed booking / package code (new Idempotency-Key each scan)
POST {{api}}/check-in/scan
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}
Idempotency-Key: scan-0001

{ "code": "SA-XXXXXXXX", "pitchId": null, "device": "Front desk" }

### Packages: quote (public)
GET {{api}}/packages/quote?pitchSlug=zayed-22&optionId=1&startsOn=2026-11-05&hour=20&duration=1

### Packages: buy
POST {{api}}/packages
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{ "pitchSlug": "zayed-22", "optionId": 1, "startsOn": "2026-11-05", "hour": 20, "duration": 1, "acceptWaiver": true }

### Sign out
POST {{api}}/auth/sign-out
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}


